{"question_id": "q09-too-large", "run": 3, "cache": "warm", "status": "ok", "error": null, "latency_s": 26.45, "provenance": {"at": "2026-10-19T23:46:11.825Z", "turn_id": "turn_2a47fdcd", "session_id": "9fe1ed6c7abc", "subject": "anonymous", "model": "eu.anthropic.claude-sonnet-5-5", "models_used": ["eu.anthropic.claude-sonnet-5-5"], "prompt_version": "a9f7e88fc432", "memory_context": false, "sdk": "pydantic-ai-slim 2.54.0", "tools_called": ["geocode", "run_operation", "run_operation"], "num_turns": 4, "duration_ms": 26134, "duration_api_ms": null, "total_cost_usd": 0.02063039, "usage": {"input_tokens": 10, "output_tokens": 1183, "cache_read_input_tokens": 33099, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1438}, "is_error": false, "retried_fresh": false, "refused": false, "error": null, "http_status": null, "runtime": "pydantic-ai", "provider": "bedrock", "cost_source": "genai-prices 0.1.13 (regional.anthropic.claude-sonnet-5-5)"}, "images": 0, "files": 0, "answer": "I couldn't get the full 5 km area. A 5 km square is 25 km\u00b2, and downloads are capped at 10 km\u00b2 per request because of memory. I downloaded a 3 km \u00d7 3 km square centred on Centralstationen instead (9 km\u00b2).\n\n**Point cloud (`obj_eeb92f03`)**\n- **Extent:** x 318176\u2013321176, y 6398880\u20136401880 (EPSG:3006)\n- **Points:** 13,886,579\n- **Median elevation:** 5.1 m. 90% of points fall between 0.8 and 33 m.\n- **Elevation range:** \u2013334 m to 503 m. The extremes look like noise or outliers, since I didn't run outlier removal.\n\n| Class | Points |\n|---|---|\n| Ground (2) | 7,588,772 |\n| Unclassified (1) | 5,862,061 |\n| Building (9) | 250,858 |\n| Water (17) | 162,022 |\n| Low point / noise (7) | 21,370 |\n| Reserved (18) | 1,496 |\n\nTo cover the full 5 km, I can download it in tiles of about 2.5 km each (four tiles, roughly 6 km\u00b2 each). Each tile is a large download, so it will be slow. I can also build a terrain mesh or a building layer from the 3 km block you now have. Which would you like?", "operations": [{"at": "2026-10-19T23:45:47.223Z", "turn_id": "turn_2a47fdcd", "session_id": "9fe1ed6c7abc", "subject": "anonymous", "tool": "geocode", "operation": null, "params_hash": "862c813d77e68dca", "seconds": 0.062, "ok": true, "error": null, "cache_hit": false, "object_refs": [], "catalogue": {"core_commit": "a78df16e9c86b349ba3a67551d518223b7897443", "operations": 133}}, {"at": "2026-10-19T23:45:49.174Z", "turn_id": "turn_2a47fdcd", "session_id": "9fe1ed6c7abc", "subject": "anonymous", "tool": "run_operation", "operation": "datasets.point_cloud", "params_hash": "fd420760f0e51296", "seconds": 0.0, "ok": false, "error": "Refused", "cache_hit": false, "object_refs": [], "catalogue": {"core_commit": "a78df16e9c86b349ba3a67551d518223b7897443", "operations": 133}}, {"at": "2026-10-19T23:45:59.847Z", "turn_id": "turn_2a47fdcd", "session_id": "9fe1ed6c7abc", "subject": "anonymous", "tool": "run_operation", "operation": "datasets.point_cloud", "params_hash": "a9b93ca1e622f611", "seconds": 7.391, "ok": true, "error": null, "cache_hit": false, "object_refs": ["obj_eeb92f03"], "catalogue": {"core_commit": "a78df16e9c86b349ba3a67551d518223b7897443", "operations": 133}}], "catalogue": {"core_commit": "a78df16e9c86b349ba3a67551d518223b7897443", "operations": 133}}
